@table(border)
| @b{Hyperparameters (\ours)} | >1 LLaMA-7B | >1 LLaMA2-7B |
| Rank r | >2 64 |
| Dropout | >2 0.0 |
| Optimizer | >2 AdamW |
| LR | >2 4e-4 |
| LR Scheduler | >2 Cosine |
| Batch size | >2 4 |
| Accumulation Steps | >2 4 |
| Warmup ratio | >2 0.1 |
| Epochs | >2 1 |
| Where | >2 Q,K,V,O,Up,Down,Gate |
@endtable

